# This repository is formulae, markdown and one workflow - there is nothing to build here, so the
# only things worth ignoring are what a machine leaves behind beside them.

# macOS Finder metadata. Written into any directory the Finder has opened, including this one.
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Editor/IDE state
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Claude Code's per-repository working directory
.claude/

# Local Homebrew output. `brew fetch`/`brew install --build-from-source` against a working-tree tap
# can drop a downloaded tarball or an unpacked tree beside the formula; only the .rb files belong.
*.tar.gz
*.bottle.tar.gz
*.bottle.json
Formula/*.tar.gz

# Trunk (.trunk/) is deliberately absent from this list: trunk is set up in single-player mode and
# excludes its own directory through .git/info/exclude, which keeps one person's linter cache out
# of a repository that has no shared trunk configuration.
